      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e If pkvm_finalise_started \u003d\u003d false, it means the deprivilege didn\u0027t happen on any CPU\n\npkvm_finalise_started is set to true only after all CPUs have successfully deprivileged. If some CPUs deprivileged but some others failed to deprivilege, we don\u0027t enter pkvm_init_finalise() and thus pkvm_finalise_started is still false, right?",
