      },
      "lineNbr": 1448,
      "author": {
        "id": 3702829
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-15T02:04:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Absolutely, bugs are more than likely, and there are chances that reprivilege can get cpus stuck. I shall move pkvm_firmware_rmem_clear() before reprivilege",
      "parentUuid": "526bb3f8_08f2b452",
      "revId": "98db7e845c96e1088088c5d6029fd35851e5e020",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
